0x40000420 B  REGISTER CCER: TIM3 capture/compare enable register
0x40000420 C   FIELD 00w01 CC1E (rw): Capture/Compare 1 output enable
0x40000420 C   FIELD 01w01 CC1P (rw): Capture/Compare 1 output Polarity
