0x40000C38 B  REGISTER CCR2 (=TIM2.CCR%s): capture/compare register
0x40000C3C B  REGISTER CCR3 (=TIM2.CCR%s): capture/compare register
0x40000C40 B  REGISTER CCR4 (=TIM2.CCR%s): capture/compare register
0x40000C58 B  REGISTER ECR (=TIM2.ECR): TIM5 timer encoder control register
