0x40000C5C C   FIELD 00w04 TI1SEL (rw): Selects tim_ti1[0..15] input ... Refer to for product specific implementation.
0x40000C5C C   FIELD 08w04 TI2SEL (rw): Selects tim_ti2[0..15] input ... Refer to for product specific implementation.
0x40000C5C C   FIELD 16w04 TI3SEL (rw): Selects tim_ti3[0..15] input ... Refer to for product specific implementation.
