0x400221C4 C   FIELD 00w32 PRIVBB2 (rw): Privileged / non-privileged 8-Kbyte flash Bank 2 sector attribute
0x400221C8 B  REGISTER PRIVBB2R3: FLASH privilege block-based register for Bank 2
0x400221C8 C   FIELD 00w32 PRIVBB2 (rw): Privileged / non-privileged 8-Kbyte flash Bank 2 sector attribute
