0x44007C24 C   FIELD 30w01 BKPWPRIV (rw): Backup registers zone 2 privilege protection
0x44007C24 C   FIELD 31w01 TAMPPRIV (rw): Tamper privilege protection (excluding backup registers) Note: Refer to for details on the read protection.
