0x44024020 C   FIELD 04w01 DBG_GPDMA1_4_STOP (rw): GPDMA1 channel 4 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 05w01 DBG_GPDMA1_5_STOP (rw): GPDMA1 channel 5 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 06w01 DBG_GPDMA1_6_STOP (rw): GPDMA1 channel 6 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 07w01 DBG_GPDMA1_7_STOP (rw): GPDMA1 channel 7 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 08w01 DBG_GPDMA1_8_STOP (rw): GPDMA1 channel 8 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 09w01 DBG_GPDMA1_9_STOP (rw): GPDMA1 channel 9 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 10w01 DBG_GPDMA1_10_STOP (rw): GPDMA1 channel 10 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 11w01 DBG_GPDMA1_11_STOP (rw): GPDMA1 channel 11 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 12w01 DBG_GPDMA1_12_STOP (rw): GPDMA1 channel 12 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 13w01 DBG_GPDMA1_13_STOP (rw): GPDMA1 channel 13 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 14w01 DBG_GPDMA1_14_STOP (rw): GPDMA1 channel 14 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 15w01 DBG_GPDMA1_15_STOP (rw): GPDMA1 channel 15 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 16w01 DBG_GPDMA2_0_STOP (rw): GPDMA2 channel 0 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 17w01 DBG_GPDMA2_1_STOP (rw): GPDMA2 channel 1 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 18w01 DBG_GPDMA2_2_STOP (rw): GPDMA2 channel 2 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 19w01 DBG_GPDMA2_3_STOP (rw): GPDMA2 channel 3 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 20w01 DBG_GPDMA2_4_STOP (rw): GPDMA2 channel 4 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 21w01 DBG_GPDMA2_5_STOP (rw): GPDMA2 channel 5 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 22w01 DBG_GPDMA2_6_STOP (rw): GPDMA2 channel 6 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 23w01 DBG_GPDMA2_7_STOP (rw): GPDMA2 channel 7 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 24w01 DBG_GPDMA2_8_STOP (rw): GPDMA2 channel 8 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 25w01 DBG_GPDMA2_9_STOP (rw): GPDMA2 channel 9 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 26w01 DBG_GPDMA2_10_STOP (rw): GPDMA2 channel 10 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 27w01 DBG_GPDMA2_11_STOP (rw): GPDMA2 channel 11 stop in debug
0x44024020 C   FIELD 28w01 DBG_GPDMA2_12_STOP (rw): GPDMA2 channel 12 stop in debug
