0x4600F000 A PERIPHERAL DLYBOS1
0x4600F000 B  REGISTER CR (rw): control register
0x4600F000 C   FIELD 00w01 DEN: Operational amplifier Enable
0x4600F000 C   FIELD 01w01 SEN: OPALPM
0x4600F004 B  REGISTER CFGR: configuration register
0x4600F004 C   FIELD 00w04 SEL (rw): SEL
