0x47000540 B  REGISTER SDCR1: SDRAM control registers 1
0x47000540 C   FIELD 00w02 NC (rw): Number of column address bits These bits define the number of bits of a column address.
0x47000540 C   FIELD 02w02 NR (rw): Number of row address bits These bits define the number of bits of a row address.
0x47000540 C   FIELD 04w02 MWID (rw): Memory data bus width. These bits define the memory device width.
0x47000540 C   FIELD 06w01 NB (rw): Number of internal banks This bit sets the number of internal banks.
