0x47000544 C   FIELD 04w02 MWID (=FMC.SDCR1.MWID) (rw): Memory data bus width. These bits define the memory device width.
0x47000544 C   FIELD 06w01 NB (=FMC.SDCR1.NB) (rw): Number of internal banks This bit sets the number of internal banks.
0x47000544 C   FIELD 07w02 CAS (=FMC.SDCR1.CAS) (rw): CAS Latency This bits sets the SDRAM CAS latency in number of memory clock cycles
0x47000544 C   FIELD 09w01 WP (=FMC.SDCR1.WP) (rw): Write protection This bit enables write mode access to the SDRAM bank.
