0x47000544 C   FIELD 12w01 RBURST (rw): Burst read This bit enables Burst read mode. The SDRAM controller anticipates the next read commands during the CAS latency and stores data in the Read FIFO. Note: The corresponding bit in the FMC_SDCR2 register is don't care.
