0x5000041C C   FIELD 24w01 OC4M_3 (=TIM3.CCMR1_Output.OC%sM_3) (rw): Output compare 4 mode, bit 3
0x50000420 B  REGISTER CCER: TIM3 capture/compare enable register
0x50000420 C   FIELD 00w01 CC1E (rw): Capture/Compare 1 output enable
