0x5000045C C   FIELD 16w04 TI3SEL (rw): Selects tim_ti3[0..15] input ... Refer to for product specific implementation.
0x5000045C C   FIELD 24w04 TI4SEL (rw): Selects tim_ti4[0..15] input ... Refer to for product specific implementation.
