0x50001424 C   FIELD 00w16 CNT (rw): Counter value Non-dithering mode (DITHEN = 0) The register holds the counter value. Dithering mode (DITHEN = 1) The register only holds the non-dithered part in CNT[15:0]. The fractional part is not available.
0x50001424 C   FIELD 31w01 UIFCPY (ro): UIF copy This bit is a read-only copy of the UIF bit of the TIMx_ISR register. If the UIFREMAP bit in TIMx_CR1 is reset, bit 31 is reserved and read as 0.
0x50001428 B  REGISTER PSC: TIM6 prescaler
0x50001428 C   FIELD 00w16 PSC (rw): Prescaler value The counter clock frequency ftim_cnt_ck is equal to ftim_psc_ck / (PSC[15:0] + 1). PSC contains the value to be loaded into the active prescaler register at each update event. (including when the counter is cleared through UG bit of TIMx_EGR register.
0x5000142C B  REGISTER ARR: TIM6 auto-reload register
0x5000142C C   FIELD 00w20 ARR (rw): Auto-reload value ARR is the value to be loaded into the actual auto-reload register. Refer to for more details about ARR update and behavior. The counter is blocked while the auto-reload value is null. Non-dithering mode (DITHEN = 0) The register holds the auto-reload value in ARR[15:0]. The ARR[19:16] bits are reserved. Dithering mode (DITHEN = 1) The register holds the integer part in ARR[19:4]. The ARR[3:0] bitfield contains the dithered part.
