0x50009404 C   FIELD 06w01 DOWNCF (wo): Direction change to down clear flag Writing 1 to this bit clear the DOWN flag in the LPTIM_ISR register. Note: If the LPTIM does not support encoder mode feature, this bit is reserved. Please refer to .
0x50009404 C   FIELD 06w01 DOWNCF (wo): Direction change to down clear flag Writing 1 to this bit clear the DOWN flag in the LPTIM_ISR register. Note: If the LPTIM does not support encoder mode feature, this bit is reserved. Please refer to .
0x50009404 C   FIELD 07w01 UECF (wo): Update event clear flag Writing 1 to this bit clear the UE flag in the LPTIM_ISR register.
