0x50009404 C   FIELD 09w01 CC2CF (wo): Capture/compare 2 clear flag Writing 1 to this bit clears the CC2IF flag in the LPTIM_ISR register. Note: If LPTIM does not implement at least 2 channels this bit is reserved. Please refer to .
0x50009404 C   FIELD 12w01 CC1OCF (wo): Capture/compare 1 over-capture clear flag Writing 1 to this bit clears the CC1OF flag in the LPTIM_ISR register. Note: If LPTIM does not implement at least 1 channel this bit is reserved. Please refer to .
