0x50030424 C   FIELD 09w03 RSIZE (rw): size for region x
0x50030424 C   FIELD 15w01 REN (rw): enable for region x
0x50030424 C   FIELD 16w11 REMAPADDR (rw): remapped address for region x This field replaces the alias address defined by BASEADDR field. The only useful bits are [31:RI], where 21 less than or equal RI less than or equal 27 is the number of bits of RSIZE (see ). If the programmed value has more LSBs, the useless bits are ignored.
0x50030424 C   FIELD 28w01 MSTSEL (rw): AHB cache master selection for region x
