0x50033400 A PERIPHERAL SEC_GTZC1_MPCBB3
0x50033400 B  REGISTER CR: GTZC1 SRAM3 MPCBB control register
0x50033400 C   FIELD 00w01 GLOCK (rw): lock the control register of the MPCBB until next reset This bit is cleared by default and once set, it can not be reset until system reset.
0x50033400 C   FIELD 30w01 INVSECSTATE (rw): SRAMx clocks security state This bit is used to define the internal SRAMs clocks control in RCC as secure or not.
0x50033400 C   FIELD 31w01 SRWILADIS (rw): secure read/write illegal access disable This bit disables the detection of an illegal access when a secure read/write transaction access a non-secure blocks of the block-based SRAM (secure fetch on non-secure block is always considered illegal).
0x50033410 B  REGISTER CFGLOCK1: GTZC1 SRAM3 MPCBB configuration lock register 1
