0x54005404 C   FIELD 12w01 CC1OCF (wo): Capture/compare 1 over-capture clear flag Writing 1 to this bit clears the CC1OF flag in the LPTIM_ISR register. Note: If LPTIM does not implement at least 1 channel this bit is reserved. Please refer to .
