0x5400540C C   FIELD 21w01 WAVPOL (rw): Waveform shape polarity The WAVEPOL bit controls the output polarity Note: If the LPTIM implements at least one capture/compare channel, this bit is reserved. Please refer to .
0x5400540C C   FIELD 22w01 PRELOAD (rw): Registers update mode The PRELOAD bit controls the LPTIM_ARR, LPTIM_RCR and the LPTIM_CCRx registers update modality
0x5400540C C   FIELD 23w01 COUNTMODE (rw): counter mode enabled The COUNTMODE bit selects which clock source is used by the LPTIM to clock the counter:
