0x54007C00 C   FIELD 16w01 ITAMP1E (rw): Internal tamper 1 enable
0x54007C00 C   FIELD 17w01 ITAMP2E (rw): Internal tamper 2 enable
0x54007C00 C   FIELD 18w01 ITAMP3E (rw): Internal tamper 3 enable
0x54007C00 C   FIELD 19w01 ITAMP4E (rw): Internal tamper 4 enable
