0x54007C30 B  REGISTER SR: TAMP status register
0x54007C30 C   FIELD 00w01 TAMP1F (ro): TAMP1 detection flag This flag is set by hardware when a tamper detection event is detected on the TAMP1 input.
0x54007C30 C   FIELD 01w01 TAMP2F (ro): TAMP2 detection flag This flag is set by hardware when a tamper detection event is detected on the TAMP2 input.
