0x54007D00 B  REGISTER BKP0R: TAMP backup 0 register
0x54007D00 C   FIELD 00w32 BKP (rw): The application can write or read data to and from these registers. In the default (ERASE) configuration this register is reset on a tamper detection event. It is forced to reset value as long as there is at least one internal or external tamper flag being set. This register is also reset when the readout protection (RDP) is disabled.
