0x54020CE0 C   FIELD 12w03 SPI5SEL (rw): SPI5 kernel clock source selection others: reserved, the kernel clock is disabled
0x54020CE0 C   FIELD 15w03 SPI6SEL (rw): SPI6 kernel clock source selection others: reserved, the kernel clock is disabled
0x54020CE0 C   FIELD 24w03 LPUART1SEL (=RCC.CCIPR1.USART1SEL) (rw): LPUART1 kernel clock source selection others: reserved, the kernel clock is disabled
0x54020CE4 B  REGISTER CCIPR4: RCC kernel clock configuration register
0x54020CE4 C   FIELD 00w02 OCTOSPI1SEL (rw): OCTOSPI1 kernel clock source selection Set and reset by software.
0x54020CE4 C   FIELD 02w02 SYSTICKSEL (rw): SYSTICK clock source selection Note: rcc_hclk frequency must be four times higher than lsi_ker_ck/lse_ck (period (LSI/LSE) greater than or equal 4 * period (HCLK).
0x54020CE4 C   FIELD 04w02 USBSEL (rw): USB kernel clock source selection
0x54020CE4 C   FIELD 06w01 SDMMC1SEL (rw): SDMMC1 kernel clock source selection
0x54020CE4 C   FIELD 07w01 SDMMC2SEL (rw): SDMMC2 kernel clock source selection
